abstract: "An unofficial, agent-neutral port of the unslop skill, which turns vibecoded, AI-looking UI into a designed interface. The original skill was created by Damir Sokolovsky (creator of the Unslopping series on X); this port republishes the same method under CC BY 4.0 for Claude Code, OpenAI Codex, opencode, Antigravity and other agents that read SKILL.md."
